---
// Projects Section Component
---

<section id="proyectos" class="py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-900">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 bg-green-500/10 border border-green-500/20 rounded-full text-sm text-green-400 mb-6">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"></path>
        </svg>
        Portafolio
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl xl:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
        Proyectos <span class="text-gradient">Destacados</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Una selección de proyectos que demuestran mi experiencia en desarrollo full stack, diseño UI/UX y soluciones innovadoras
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Projects Grid -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Rentinno Project -->
      <div class="group bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700/50 rounded-3xl p-8 hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer">
        <div class="text-center mb-6">
          <img src="https://rentinno.com.mx/img/logo_1_n.png" alt="Rentinno Logo" class="h-20 w-auto mx-auto mb-4 grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Rentinno</h3>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"></path>
            </svg>
            Co-fundador
          </span>
        </div>

        <p class="text-slate-400 mb-6 text-center leading-relaxed">
          Plataforma de gestión de propiedades en renta con calendario inteligente, notificaciones automáticas, recibos digitales y conexión directa con clientes.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center">
          <a href="https://rentinno.com.mx/app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-slate-900 font-semibold rounded-xl transition-all duration-200 hover:scale-105 cursor-pointer">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path>
            </svg>
            Ver Plataforma
          </a>
          <a href="https://rentinno.com.mx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 bg-slate-700/80 hover:bg-slate-600/80 text-white font-medium rounded-xl transition-all duration-200 hover:scale-105 cursor-pointer">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9m9-9a9 9 0 00-9-9m9 9H3m9 9a9 9 0 01-9-9m9 9c1.657 0 3-4.03 3-9s-1.343-9-3-9m0 18c-1.657 0-3-4.03-3-9s1.343-9 3-9m-9 9a9 9 0 019-9"></path>
            </svg>
            Sitio Web
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Slary Project -->
      <div class="group bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700/50 rounded-3xl p-8 hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer">
        <div class="text-center mb-6">
          <img src="/assets/slary.png" alt="Slary Logo" class="h-20 w-auto mx-auto mb-4 grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Slary</h3>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M11 3.055A9.001 9.001 0 1020.945 13H11V3.055z"></path>
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M20.488 9H15V3.512A9.025 9.025 0 0120.488 9z"></path>
            </svg>
            Fundador
          </span>
        </div>

        <p class="text-slate-400 mb-6 text-center leading-relaxed">
          Aplicación móvil diseñada para la gestión y organización de nóminas digitales. Permite importar, visualizar, organizar y compartir documentos de nómina de manera eficiente y segura.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center">
          <a href="/slary" class="group flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-400 text-slate-900 font-semibold rounded-xl transition-all duration-200 hover:scale-105 cursor-pointer">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2 group-hover:rotate-12 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
            </svg>
            Ver Información
          </a>
          <a href="/slary#features" class="flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 bg-slate-700/80 hover:bg-slate-600/80 text-white font-medium rounded-xl transition-all duration-200 hover:scale-105 cursor-pointer">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M11.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.519 4.674a1 1 0 00.95.69h4.915c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-3.976 2.888a1 1 0 00-.363 1.118l1.518 4.674c.3.922-.755 1.688-1.538 1.118l-3.976-2.888a1 1 0 00-1.176 0l-3.976 2.888c-.783.57-1.838-.197-1.538-1.118l1.518-4.674a1 1 0 00-.363-1.118l-3.976-2.888c-.784-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h4.914a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.519-4.674z"></path>
            </svg>
            Características
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- GitHub CTA -->
    <div class="text-center mt-16">
      <div class="bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700/50 rounded-3xl p-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-slate-700/50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
          <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-slate-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">¿Quieres ver más proyectos?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 mb-6">
          Explora mi repositorio completo en GitHub con más de 50 proyectos, desde aplicaciones web hasta herramientas de automatización.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/ryxploit"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="group inline-flex items-center px-8 py-4 bg-white hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 font-semibold rounded-xl transition-all duration-200 hover:scale-105 cursor-pointer"
        >
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"/>
          </svg>
          Ver GitHub
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>